00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:06.549
All right. Some very interesting comments
and ideas from our audience through the David

00:00:06.549 --> 00:00:17.440
Pakman show subreddit. You can find the subreddit@davidpakman.com
slash r e d d t. Now boasting more than 14,000

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:23.699
David Pakman show viewers, one of the largest
independent media subreddits out there.

00:00:23.699 --> 00:00:29.349
And there's an interesting question here from
a user called Ian Hourglass, which is David,

00:00:29.349 --> 00:00:35.070
can you ask Youtube to make your channel authoritative
and they make a good point, which is we've

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:40.200
been talking about how youtube has been using
this coded language. We are going to prioritize

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:45.010
authoritative news content at the expense
of non authoritative news content. And I've

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:50.440
explained many times we are caught up in this
as non authoritative and thus we are suffering

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:54.550
the consequences that a lot of the conspiracy
channels and others are suffering. So this

00:00:54.550 --> 00:01:00.980
is a great idea. If the David Pakman show
youtube channel could be marked as an authoritative

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:06.980
news source by youtube, it would be hugely
beneficial. However, as the first person who

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:13.720
responded to this said, authoritative is not
actually about authority, it's code for corporate

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:19.190
media. And that's why I think it is a great
idea. I would love for our channel to be designated

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:24.220
authoritative for our own benefit, but it's
code for corporate media to the to the greatest

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:27.970
extent that I can tell and thus I don't know
that that's something we can convince youtube

00:01:27.970 --> 00:01:28.970
to do.

